i love  but  this feels like  it's trying to be a culmination  of something that had very little  concrete foundation like there were  little bits that you could read  possibly  as yeah as having a crush on the doctor  but this is like the first real solid  confirmation and we've only got to have  a couple more episodes after this in  which to deal with all that  that's  as a moment in and of itself in terms of  the interactions between yaz and dan  it's decently done  and i think i got some of yaz's  frustration the way the doctor felt like  she was going to start to open up and  then close down again  that's another part of the problem  though this doctor has been so  inaccessible emotionally to her  companions and even for yaz who's been  there the longest that it also feels  like really  what is this crush based on  she does not open up to you  you do not know her very well she hasn't  let you know her very well yes i know  crutches can be superficial not based  off deep knowledge but it  that's that's something that happens in  reality but it's not satisfying as a  narrative it's not satisfying as a story  so  i don't think it's an inherently bad  idea you know my own distaste for  romantic subplots aside i just  i don't know this does not feel like it  was developed to get to this point even  though the actual execution of this in  and of itself is okay it's just on a  foundation that is flimsy and possibly  non-existent  so  that should probably balance out  all my praise that i had earlier but  honestly  i had a lot of fun with this  i enjoyed the characters the new and the  old i liked the dynamic of everybody  involved i like the use of the daleks uh  it was a little odd that it felt like  the reveal of this was happening because  of the tardis was held for as long as it  was he's like is anybody surprised by  that i kind of assumed that was the case  right from the get-go but  whatever last nitpick i think uh but  overall i had fun with this i consider  this to be one of chibnall's better  episodes as far as the ones that he's  written by himself  so  take that as a qualified compliment  which  you know whatever but i didn't come away  from this frustrated i didn't come away  from this annoying i didn't come away  from this going oh for god's sake and we  get the sea devils next time i've been  waiting on a return for the sea devils  so i'm down for that we'll see what we  get  but yeah there's issues  but i had fun  eve of the daleks what you think about  it whatever your thoughts are drop  something down the comments let's talk  about it like share subscribe got the  patreon that's how i pay my bills and  i'm able to keep this entire operation  up and running rewards for every tier of  support there's also a link for that in  the description plus links for other  stuff besides if you want to check me  out on twitter or twitch or instagram or  what have you plus my p.o box address if  you're feeling like you want to send me  something hey  always happy to get stuff  but that is enough of me shilling for  myself because at the end of the day my  friends you are the council i just run  the meetings so until next time this  council  is adjourned  [Music]  none of this would have been possible  without my supporters over on patreon in  particular i want to thank robin powell  raven mcbain tracy scrabbit vincent paul  bartolucci robin moore and shayla  gourley if you'd like to hear me  possibly mispronounce your name maybe  consider looking at the reward tears  over on the patreon  but either way don't worry about it too  much  take care of yourself  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  um  [Music]
 

